Sercle fled the scene but was arrested days later, on Thursday, August 29, when he returned to book another hotel room, and was charged with aggravated battery."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-10 rounded-xl bg-paper-soft p-6","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm font-semibold text-ink","children":"Score breakdown"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-5 space-y-4","children":[["$","div","Absurdity",{"children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"mb-1.5 flex items-center justify-between gap-3 text-sm font-medium","children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"Absurdity"}],["$","span",null,{"style":{"color":"#FF6B35"},"children":[20,"/",25]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"h-2.5 w-full overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-line","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"h-full rounded-full","style":{"width":"80%","backgroundColor":"#FF6B35"}}]}]]}],["$","div","Humor",{"children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"mb-1.5 flex items-center justify-between gap-3 text-sm font-medium","children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"Humor"}],["$","span",null,{"style":{"color":"#FFC93C"},"children":[10,"/",25]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"h-2.5 w-full overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-line","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"h-full rounded-full","style":{"width":"40%","backgroundColor":"#FFC93C"}}]}]]}],["$","div","Florida Factor",{"children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"mb-1.5 flex items-center justify-between gap-3 text-sm font-medium","children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"Florida Factor"}],["$","span",null,{"style":{"color":"#00B8A9"},"children":[14,"/",20]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"h-2.5 w-full overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-line","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"h-full rounded-full","style":{"width":"70%","backgroundColor":"#00B8A9"}}]}]]}],["$","div","Unexpectedness",{"children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"mb-1.5 flex items-center justify-between gap-3 text-sm font-medium","children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"Unexpectedness"}],"$L1a"]}],"$L